WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:06.128
"Nero ran into the woods!" Dev said.

2
00:00:06.129 --> 00:00:09.028
"Nero! Come!"

3
00:00:09.029 --> 00:00:14.014
"Duke can find him," Pam said. "Fetch!"

4
00:00:14.015 --> 00:00:21.299
The big dog took off.

5
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:26.835
Nero was exploring the woods.

6
00:00:26.836 --> 00:00:28.886
Leaves rustled.

7
00:00:28.887 --> 00:00:36.557
He sniffed. "Ugh! Duke is coming!"

8
00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:40.337
Nero hid under a log.

9
00:00:40.338 --> 00:00:43.037
Duke barked. "Woof! Woof!"

10
00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:46.866
"I'm not telling you where I am," Nero thought.

11
00:00:46.867 --> 00:00:49.704
But Nero didn't need to.

12
00:00:49.705 --> 00:00:53.166
Duke found him anyway.

13
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:59.604
"Grr!" Nero sprinted away, and Duke followed.

14
00:00:59.605 --> 00:01:03.996
"Leave me alone!" Nero thought.

15
00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:08.111
He made a sharp turn through tall grass.

16
00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:12.592
Splurk! He landed in a puddle of mud.

17
00:01:12.593 --> 00:01:17.013
Duke jumped into the mud. Sploomf!

18
00:01:17.014 --> 00:01:20.330
Duke barked again. "Woof!"

19
00:01:20.331 --> 00:01:26.043
Nero gasped. "He wants to be friends.

20
00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:30.659
Nero barked to say, "Let's play!"

21
00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:33.624
The two dogs rolled in the mud.

22
00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:36.468
They splashed and wrestled.

23
00:01:36.469 --> 00:01:40.606
They snapped their teeth—but not too hard.

24
00:01:40.607 --> 00:01:44.143
Then they started chasing each other.

25
00:01:44.144 --> 00:01:48.207
"This is fun!" Nero thought.

26
00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:52.260
The two friends tumbled and slid.

27
00:01:52.261 --> 00:01:55.378
Nero bumped into a tree. Bam!

28
00:01:55.379 --> 00:01:58.884
Duke kept sliding—into a muddy ditch!

29
00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:04.208
Duke slid under a log and yelped. "Arf!"

30
00:02:04.209 --> 00:02:11.707
Nero gasped. "You've hurt your leg!"

31
00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:15.657
"Woof!" Nero barked. "I'll get help!"

32
00:02:15.658 --> 00:02:20.696
He ran back toward the school.

33
00:02:20.697 --> 00:02:25.397
Nero saw Dev coming into the woods.

34
00:02:25.398 --> 00:02:30.283
"Dev!" Nero yelled. "I need—oops!"

35
00:02:30.284 --> 00:02:33.831
Nero slapped a paw over his mouth.

36
00:02:33.832 --> 00:02:36.718
Pam was with Dev.

37
00:02:36.719 --> 00:02:42.734
The trainer looked around. "Did someone call your name?"

38
00:02:42.735 --> 00:02:48.937
Dev bit his lip. "Um, I don't think so."

39
00:02:48.938 --> 00:02:51.970
He clipped the leash onto Nero's harness.

40
00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:56.790
"You're covered in mud. Where's Duke?"

41
00:02:56.791 --> 00:03:01.215
"Duke will be fine," Pam said.

42
00:03:01.216 --> 00:03:05.105
"He's perfectly trained and will come back soon."

43
00:03:05.106 --> 00:03:08.716
"No, he won't!" Nero thought.

44
00:03:08.717 --> 00:03:11.836
He tried to pull Dev toward Duke.

45
00:03:11.837 --> 00:03:17.543
"No, Nero," Dev said. "We're going back to school."

46
00:03:17.544 --> 00:03:20.366
Nero didn't know what to do.

47
00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:24.381
"I can't talk in front of Pam," Nero thought.

48
00:03:24.382 --> 00:03:28.459
"But Duke needs help—fast!"
